          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 150188,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Guardando il codice qui sotto, riesci a capire facilmente che cosa dovrebbe rappresentare ogni frammento di testo? No, non proprio.</p><p>Impariamo a usare gli elementi HTML semantici per dare più significato al testo in una pagina web dell'interfaccia di un gioco.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  Level Complete!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  You defeated the boss and earned 1200 points.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Next round starts at 5:00 PM and the speed boost lasts 2m 30s.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  Save point location:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    100 Main St.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    Austin, TX 78741\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 150189,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
